      "writtenOn": "2024-09-09T16:13:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: I know @brianosman@google.com dislike the facts chromium/dawn/pdfium/etc... developers are relying on `./build_overrides` files. Some of those variables could be moved into `.gn` or `gn/BUILDCONFIG`, in particular the `is_xxx` common variables, if you really want.\nI decided not to to avoid parts of Skia to start depending on those variables to exist.\n\nAt some point, I would like to stop depending on them to be defined.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "ce01ae29c141568bddb40bc9c2e521126830cb82",
