      "writtenOn": "2024-09-09T16:54:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is fine. More importantly: This Friday (September 13) will be my last working day, so someone else on the Skia team will have to assist with the MiraclePtr work. hcm@ and egdaniel@ can hopefully find someone else to assist.\n\nAlso: +kjlubick for build visibility. Bazel work has accelerated, and that might mean adding bazel support for PA before too long?",
      "parentUuid": "cf519fda_6cce4201",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "ce01ae29c141568bddb40bc9c2e521126830cb82",
